    "detailed_description": "The Oneiric Collection is the new way to visit museum and architectures. <br />\r\nIn this chapter we invite you in one of the most beautiful Paris square : &quot;La Place Vend\u00f4me&quot;. Here you'll find more than 20 masterpieces among the most beautifull you could find in Paris (The Venus de Milo, The Mona Lisa, The Winged victory of Samothrace... )<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove freely on the square and interact with all the masterpieces (scale and rotate them) use an audio guide or an info panel. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur 3D graphic technic will provide you the best experience with very realistic 3D models. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnjoy the most advanced VR museum visit experience ! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe added some easter eggs. Will you be able to find them ?",
